NBSAP_2.activities:
2.1 Restore degraded forest ecosystems;
2.2 Restore land degraded by mining activities;
2.3 Restore degraded land, pastureland and abandoned land;
2.4 Restore water, wetlands, river and lake ecosystems

NBSAP_3.activities:
3.1. Identify and assess areas under Other Effective area-based Conservation Measures (OECMs);
3.2. Develop, legalize and implement a national protected areas and conservation area strategy and action plan;
3.3. Designate forest, steppe and peatland areas under protection, including representative ecosystems;
3.4. Update the legal framework for protected areas and implement participatory conservation management;
3.5. Increase management effectiveness of protected areas;
3.6. Expand and conserve ecological corridors and connectivity areas;
3.7. Improve management through strengthened transboundary protected area cooperation
